{"id":"gelegen","lemma":"gelegen","pos":"adj","rank":3683,"glosses":["situated","convenient"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cb/De-gelegen.ogg/De-gelegen.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"gelegener","superlative":"am gelegensten"},"examples":[{"text":"Eine Waffe könnte gelegen kommen.","en":"A gun might come in handy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760858","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"weapon, arm"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"to come"}]},{"text":"Ich habe gelegen.","en":"I was lying.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391120","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null]},{"text":"Wie lange hast du im Krankenhaus gelegen?","en":"How long were you in the hospital?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"hospital"},null]},{"text":"Das Buch hat noch gestern dort gelegen.","en":"The book was still there yesterday.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"there, yonder"},null]},{"text":"Die Stadt ist auf einem Abhang gelegen.","en":"The town is situated on a slope.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"city"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"slope, incline"},null]}]}